                <pb facs="0942" n="932" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv08/pg932"/>

                <head>Appendix J to HD–82</head>
                <p rendition="#center">[<hi rendition="#italic">The European Danube Commission to
                        the Supreme Council</hi>]</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">The European Danube Commission:</p>
                <p>Whereas Article 349 of the Peace Treaty with Germany provides for the early
                    meeting of an International Conference to establish the regime which is to apply
                    to the Danube throughout its entire internationalized course; whereas it is
                    indispensable that the European Danube Commission be represented in this
                    Conference to indicate the <pb facs="0943" n="933" xml:id="pg933"/> interests it
                    represents and to furnish the benefits of its experience in Danubian
                    affairs;</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">Decides;</p>
                <p>to request the Supreme Council of the Allies to kindly assure the representation
                    of the European Danube Commission in the said Conference.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
